  "implementation": {
    "indices": "New gameplayBodyIndices changes only referenced source indices. Strict LockBorder, ratio0.12/error0.006. No Permissive/Prune/Sloppy/vertex relocation/attribute updates in final body operator. Source raw arrays and both relative POSITION/NORMAL blink targets remain exact.",
