    "categoricalAndSeams": "Tangent handedness remains categorical; mixed-handedness or over-capacity triangles retain exact source corners. Bone palettes partition triangles within handedness/moving categories. Shared boundary/conflicting skin/blink positions are locked, including coincident position copies. If a protected complete raw vertex signature disappears, preserve its incident source triangles as an exact collar and lock the new interface; at most8repair rounds, then exact original partition fallback. Empty results also keep exact source indices.",
