    "qaTransport": "Body,gear/eye and shadow capture now return the same numeric source data in one JSON string, avoiding per-number Playwright protocol objects. Two High peer-close failures are retained; final same-policy High/Low runs stay connected. Server liveness, socket expectations and timeouts remain unchanged. This is a QA transport repair, not a production network fix."
